"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5125840","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4515870-1846018067928753","game_id":"steam-4515870","kind":"announcement","title":"Important: Release Delay Announcement","summary":"Thank you very much for your continued support of - GRIMOIRE - The Lost Ritual .We have an important announcement regarding the release date.Originally, we planned to release the full version in December 2026, around the time of Winter Comiket. However, after reviewing our development schedule, we have decided to postpone the release.We sincerely apologize to everyone who has been looking forward to the game.■ Why are we postponing the release?There is still a considerable amount of work remaini","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T08:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928753","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4515870-1842212951312783","game_id":"steam-4515870","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIMOIRE - The Lost Ritual -』 Demo Now Available!","summary":"『GRIMOIRE - The Lost Ritual -』 Demo Now Available!Hello everyone! This is MURINGO, the developer of GRIMOIRE - The Lost Ritual -.Sorry for the late announcement, but the demo version of GRIMOIRE - The Lost Ritual - is now available!The demo is already playable, so if you've been curious about the game, we hope you'll take this opportunity to give it a try.■ A Demo Like an “Interactive PV”This demo is structured a little differently from a typical demo that lets you play through the beginning of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T09:23:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951312783","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4515870-1839676055893068","game_id":"steam-4515870","kind":"update","title":"Development Update & Release Schedule","summary":"Development Update & Release ScheduleHello everyone, This is MURINGO, the developer of GRIMOIRE - The Lost Ritual -.Today, we would like to share an update regarding the game's chapter structure and our development schedule.Originally, the game was planned as a six-chapter visual novel. However, the development period has turned out to be shorter than originally expected, and our schedule has become increasingly tight.After reconsidering the overall development process, we have decided to change","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T17:52:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055893068","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4515870-1831432155565613","game_id":"steam-4515870","kind":"update","title":"Development Update & Announcement","summary":"■ Development ProgressWe have made significant progress on Chapter 4.Chapter 4 Graphics: CompletedChapter 4 Music: CompletedWith these completed, we have now moved on to the next stage: programming and script implementation.■ What’s NextThe story is gradually approaching its core, and more important developments are coming ahead.We will continue working at full speed toward completion.■ SupportIf you are interested, please consider adding the game to your Steam Wishlist.Your support means a lot ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T15:53:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155565613","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4515870-1828894815565368","game_id":"steam-4515870","kind":"announcement","title":"Development Progress Report | Chapter 4 in Production","summary":"■ Current ProgressScenario: 97%Illustrations: 70%Coding / Script: 58%■ About Chapter 4Chapter 4 contains many major turning points in the story, including battle scenes and important character introductions.Because of this, the number of animation illustrations has become extremely large. This chapter alone is approaching 70 artwork pieces.To be honest, it is a huge challenge, but this part is also one of the highlights of the game, so quality remains our top priority.■ What Comes NextOnce Chapt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-06T14:38:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815565368","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4515870-1828441623112153","game_id":"steam-4515870","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIMOIRE — The Lost Ritual","summary":"The story follows a university student whose ordinary life begins to collapse after a series of supernatural incidents and the discovery of forbidden grimoires.Game features: ・6+ hours of story content ・500+ illustrations and backgrounds ・20+ original music tracks ・Full support for English, Japanese, and Russian ・Cinematic storytelling and immersive horror atmosphereThis project is being developed with great care and passion.If the game interests you, please consider adding it to your Steam Wish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T13:06:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623112153","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4515870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-2